  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up implementation of ESD,ESD, Health ED and Culture ED in East Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the needs of East Asian countries UNESCO will strengthen capacity of Ministries of Education and national institutions to scale-up implementation of ESDfor2030 roadmap (2021-2030), GCED and health education and Culture education at all levels to provide learners and experts with the knowledge, skills, values, attitudes and behaviors needed to live healthy lives, promote sustainable development and act as responsible global citizens, and advance the agenda on SDG 13, 15 &amp; SDG4.7 and 4.a, and contribute to the other SDGs related to health, sustainable consumption and climate change. The planned activities will be aligned with the National SDG strategies and UNSDCFs in China, Mongolia and DPRK</narrative>
  </description>
